	(text "Asumsi Vin = 12V\nVout max = Vin - 2V = 10V\n\nRumus Dasar: Vout = Vref * (1 + (R_atas / R_bawah))\nVref = 1.23V\nR_atas (Potensiometer RV1) = 0 ohm s/d 10k ohm\nR_bawah (Resistor Tetap R1) = 1.5k ohm\n\n- Titik Minimum (Saat RV1 = 0 ohm):\nVout = 1.23V * (1 + (0 / 1500)) = 1.23V\n\n- Titik Maksimum (Saat RV1 = 10k ohm):\nVout = 1.23V * (1 + (10000 / 1500)) = 9.43V\n(Memenuhi kriteria maksimal kurang dari 10V)"
